style amenities including an infinity pool, gymnasium, banquet hall, multipurpose court, kids’ play area, landscaped gardens, and multilevel parking with EV charging provisions to support a contemporary lifestyle.  Strategically located, the project is well connected to Malad Railway Station, Western Express Highway, Dahanukar Wadi Metro, Infinity Mall, schools, hospitals, and business hubs, ensuring convenience and strong neighbourhood appeal for both residents and investors.\",\"title\":\"\",\"smallDescription\":\"\",\"projectYoutubeLink\":[],\"locationHighlightsText\":\"\",\"isLuxury\":false,\"projectHighlights\":[{\"distance\":\"0.9 km\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"ORCHIDS The International School\",\"highlightType\":\"School\"},{\"distance\":\"1.0 km\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Zenith Hospital\",\"highlightType\":\"Hospital\"},{\"distance\":\"2.1\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Malad\",\"highlightType\":\"Railway Station\"},{\"distance\":\"2.0 km\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Axis Bank Branch\",\"highlightType\":\"Bank\"},{\"distance\":\"0.02\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Goonj Music School (Malad)\",\"highlightType\":\"School\"},{\"distance\":\"0.1\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Free Guitar classes at your home| Guitar classes in Mumbai | Guitar classes near me | Guitar classes at home | No fees\",\"highlightType\":\"School\"},{\"distance\":\"0.2\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"Juthika's Alchemy Studio\",\"highlightType\":\"School\"},{\"distance\":\"0.3\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"placeName\":\"St. Joseph's School\",\"highlightType\":\"School\"},{\"distance\":\"0.9\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":null,\"longitude\":null,\"place