            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Project</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-roboto text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">Shreeji Atlantis is a premium residential high rise located in Malad West, Mumbai, developed by Shreeji Group of Companies. The project features a 45 storey tower offering thoughtfully designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and some larger configurations with typical sizes ranging from approx. 734–980 sq. ft. and prices around ₹1.6 Cr–₹2.5 Cr+ depending on unit type and size—making it suited to families seeking modern urban living.  Spread across several acres within the larger Shreeji SuperNest community, Atlantis provides 30+ lifestyle amenities including an infinity pool, gymnasium, banquet hall, multipurpose court, kids’ play area, landscaped gardens, and multilevel parking with EV charging provisions to support a contemporary lifestyle.  Strategically located, the project is well connected to Malad Railway Station, Western Express Highway, Dahanukar Wadi Metro, Infinity Mall, schools, hospitals, and business hubs, ensuring convenience and strong neighbourhood appeal for both residents and investors</p></div></section><section id="amenities" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="amenities"><div class="flex flex-col "><div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-nowrap mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="max-w-full w-auto"><h2 class="relative inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline px-0 text-text-primary font-medium font-plusJakarta text-[18px] md:text-[24px] "><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline"><span class="relative inline-block mr-1 md:mb-1"><span class="relative z-0">Amenities</span></span><span class="absolute left-0 w-[32px] md:w-[64px] h-[2px] md:h-1 rounded-t-2xl bg-primary z-0 mt-1 
