          "></span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><div class="w-full"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-y-3 gap-x-4 md:gap-y-8 md:gap-x-[18px] font-roboto mt-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex"><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[30px] md:h-[30px]"><img src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/children-play-area-56fac0.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy"/></div><span class="text-sm md:text-lg text-text-primary font-medium">Children&#x27;s Play Area</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex"><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[30px] md:h-[30px]"><img src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/meditation-hall-e68efc.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy"/></div><span class="text-sm md:text-lg text-text-primary font-medium">Meditation Zone</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex"><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[30px] md:h-[30px]"><img src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy"/></div><span class="text-sm md:text-lg text-text-primary font-medium">Swimming Pool</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex"><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[30px] md:h-[30px]"><img src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/club-house.svg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy"/></div><span class="text-sm md:text-lg text-text-primary font-medium">Club House</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex"><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[30px] md:h-[30px]"><img src="https