econdary border border-white/20"><div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-bgSecondary/80 backdrop-blur-[2px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"><div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-primary border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div><p class="text-sm text-label font-medium">Initializing Map...</p></div></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-2 mt-6 px-2"></div></div></div><section id="rera-registered" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="rera"><section class="bg-white rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row lg:flex-col xl:flex-row shadow-[1px_1px_8.4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] border-t-[5px] md:border-t-0 md:border-l-[5px] lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-[5px] xl:border-t-0 xl:border-l-[5px] border-primary font-roboto"><div class="flex-1 p-6 flex flex-col justify-start"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 border border-success bg-[#E7FFF0] text-success rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 w-max font-medium font-plusJakarta text-sm md:text-base mb-6"><img alt="Verified" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/green-check.svg"/>RERA Verified Project</div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 md:mb-4 lg:mb-2 xl:mb-4"><h3 class="text-[14px] md:text-[24px] font-mendium text-text-primary">What is RERA ?</h3></div><div class="text-text-secondary text-sm md:text-[20px] leading-relaxed space-y-4"><p>RERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.</p><p>Its primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.</p></div><div class="mt-4 md:mt-7 flex justify-center md:justify-end lg:justify-center xl:justify-end w-full"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-