            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Developer</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-4 md:mt-4 p-2"><a aria-label="Open Shreeji Group page" title="Shreeji Group" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-[71px] h-[57px] sm:w-[147px] sm:h-[91px] rounded-md transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-105 focus:scale-105]" href="/builder/shreeji-group-1"><img alt="Shreeji Group" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-group-logo-jpg-2-f9fab2.jpg"/></a><div class="md:ml-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-text-primary font-medium text-base md:text-2xl font-roboto">Shreeji Group</span><img alt="Check" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 md:h-5 md:w-5" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/green-check.svg"/></div><p class="text-text-primary text-xs md:text-sm mt-2 md:mt-4">Years of Experience –<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">93<!-- --> years</span></p></div></div><div class="w-full h-px bg-[#9A9A9A80] my-4"></div><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-text-secondary text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">Shreeji Group is a dedicated developer focused on creating residential spaces that are
&quot;extraordinary in thought, design, and lifestyle.&quot; Their projects, such as Shreeji Today Royal,
are designed to be an echo of the homeowner’s personality, status, and achievements. They
emphasize meticulous craftsmanship and glorious elevations to raise the bar for elite living in
Navi Mumbai. The developer prioritizes the emotional experience of the resident, ensuring
that the entrance and interiors are filled with positivity and a welcoming feel. By integrating
nature seamlessly with modern amenities, Shreeji Group creates environments that promote
peace, harmony, and happiness. Their commitment to quality is evident in their selection of
prime locations like Kharghar, where they build landmarks that reflect aspirations.</p></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 md:py-4 px-2 rounded-[6px] bg-white mt-4"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">3</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base text-text-primary">Projects</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Completed</span></div><div class="w-px self-stretch bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">5</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base  text-text-primary">Ongoing</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Projects</span></div><div class="w-px self-stretch bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">1</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base text-text-primary">In City</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Projects</span></div></div><div class="mt-6 md:mt-8 px-2 md:px-0"><a target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full" href="/builder/shreeji-group-1"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full transition  h-[32px] md:h-[36px] px-6 font-roboto text-[12px] md:text-[14px] lg:text-[16px] bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark w-full !rounded-full !py-3 text-sm md:text-lg font-medium">View Details</button></a></div></div></section><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><section class="py-3 md:py-7"><section class="w-full py-3 md:py-7 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 border border-gray-100"><div class="max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-secondary mb-6">Disclaimer</h2><div class="font-roboto space-y-4 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed text-justify text-text-secondary transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden relative max-h-[100px]"><p>NoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.</p><p>The data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.</p><p>No information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p><p class="pt-2">For feedback or concerns, email: <a href="mailto:support@nobrokerage.com" class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">support@nobrokerage.com</a></p><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-50/90 to-transparent"></div></div><button class="mt-4 text-primary font-bold text-xs md:text-sm hover:underline uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">Read More</button></div></section></section><section id="reviews" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="reviews"><div class="w-full h-64 flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-primary border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-medium">Loading reviews...</p></div></div></section><div class="min-h-[1px]" s